    {
      "before_op_index": 47,
      "note": "REPAIR A - re-place the seven capacitors: one per selector contact, at that contact's own y, x ascending with contact number. Rotation 270 is left untouched, because a capacitor's fields are stored at angle 90 and only render horizontal at 270."
